						<r3d:remarks>The GeoConnections Discovery Portal was an on-line metadata catalogue of geospatial and geoscience data products and Web services for Canada. The technologies of the Canadian Geospatial Data Infrastructure have matured and reside in federal, provincial and territorial portals.
We encourage you to explore these resources for current information on geospatial products and services. In particular we wish to point you to, GeoGratis http://geogratis.cgdi.gc.ca/ and Open Government, open data http://open.canada.ca/en
GeoConnections Discovery Portal was the Canadian node of the CEOS International Directory Network.
